{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-32","kind":"proposition","title":"构造与求解：可公度量与中项无理线段与平方","englishTitle":"To find two medial straight lines commensurable in square only, containing a medial rectangle, and such that the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable with the greater.","book":10,"number":32,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":32,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","contentId":"euclid-10-32","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a495b6a9e7609a60a1cbba9fe900a47b508be0bc27e5e0e939a79040eb71eca","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-32.statement","euclid-10-32.construction.1","euclid-10-32.proof.1","euclid-10-32.construction.2","euclid-10-32.proof.2","euclid-10-32.proof.3","euclid-10-32.proof.4","euclid-10-32.proof.5","euclid-10-32.proof.6","euclid-10-32.proof.7","euclid-10-32.proof.8","euclid-10-32.proof.9","euclid-10-32.proof.10","euclid-10-32.proof.11","euclid-10-32.proof.12","euclid-10-32.proof.13","euclid-10-32.proof.14","euclid-10-32.proof.15","euclid-10-32.proof.16","euclid-10-32.proof.17","euclid-10-32.proof.18","euclid-10-32.conclusion","euclid-10-32.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-32.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"63d84d0ec45080663de9b8b68ce5491d0cc6f1a4f957b771989d4c6eab07e944","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To find two medial straight lines commensurable in square only, containing a medial rectangle, and such that the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable with the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"发现2,中项无理线段,平方可公度而长度不可公度, 含中项无理线段,矩形, 且数量较大的正方形, 大于数量较小的正方形, 与数量较大的直线可公度, 直线的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e78b25a8ec6b3aa365e0a1d94a8cbce6d827b30e7d64adbda4c75631282f1c1","citations":["euclid-10-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be set out three rational straight lines A, B, C commensurable in square only, and such that the square on A is greater than the square on C by the square on a straight line commensurable with A, [[X. 29](/principles/euclid-10-29)] and let the square on D be equal to the rectangle A, B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"列出三条有理线段 A, B, C 平方可公度而长度不可公度, A的正方形比C的正方形, 直线可公度和A的正方形, D的正方形等于矩形 A, B。 [[X. 29](/principles/euclid-10-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c6f704061a809d5f963312460bdf5d37d6a5aafcaae5010f784b56bc743db512","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on D is medial; therefore D is also medial. [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,D的正方形是中项无理线段;D也是中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"edc635d800e916df216ef0236778f6df9dc02b439c1cfec6ff09350330fc521c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the rectangle D, E be equal to the rectangle B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E 等于 矩形 B C D D"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c20503b0e976bd9e881fbc84cd29d39cac0200fb9b52026564d52a463c469a2c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then since, as the rectangle A, B is to the rectangle B, C, so is A to C; while the square on D is equal to the rectangle A, B, and the rectangle D, E is equal to the rectangle B, C, therefore, as A is to C, so is the square on D to the rectangle D, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"之后,由于矩形 A,B为矩形 B,C,A至C;D的正方形等于矩形 A,B,,E等于矩形 B,C,A与D,E,矩形,A与C,D,正方形之比等于D,矩形与矩形,D,E"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a46ab2a9b545a1ab96f63df0ac67d6687d7da0c412401953994ae1def7889c8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the square on D is to the rectangle D, E, so is D to E; therefore also, as A is to C, so is D to E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,D的正方形是矩形 D,E,D和E,D和E也是这样;因此,A和C的比等于D和E的比；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a903c76a43650d20bd3f3b98970ca958125ae0d5ed47898a7e1b8701890d9052","citations":["euclid-10-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But A is commensurable with C in square only; therefore D is also commensurable with E in square only. [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但A为可公度,正方形为C;因此,D也是可公度,E只为正方形。 [[X. 11](/principles/euclid-10-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5acff6f6029ce5309cb8fc6f78433e6870a616c7e98967e5c79e910642c18f9a","citations":["euclid-10-23"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D is medial; therefore E is also medial. [[X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23), addition]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D是中项无理线段,因此E也是中项无理线段。 [ [X. 23](/principles/euclid-10-23)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0050d16d3adbe26c26975d53bc79e79cf62044b74d63b6624369ce57a9ad8084","citations":["euclid-10-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since, as A is to C, so is D to E, while the square on A is greater than the square on C by the square on a straight line commensurable with A, therefore also the square on D will be greater than the square on E by the square on a straight line commensurable with D.[[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A比C等于D比E,A比正方形比正方形比A比正方形比A比正方形,D比正方形比正方形,D比正方形比E比正方形比可公度比D；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[X. 14](/principles/euclid-10-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dcbb8ec6782789b001078db1a0109df93fb7979187af3bcbe44cdbec2a57c1bb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that the rectangle D, E is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,矩形 D,E也是中项无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ceaf0c11a00faac4ba340dae7fb888d3cf9f1ec6d74e439989820d9a6326b73","citations":["euclid-10-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since the rectangle B, C is equal to the rectangle D, E, while the rectangle B, C is medial, [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)] therefore the rectangle D, E is also medial."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为矩形 B,C等于矩形 D,E等于矩形 B,C等于中项无理线段,因此矩形 D等于中项无理线段。 [[X. 21](/principles/euclid-10-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"40c39c437231a5eca743b695d5115a7b8711182bccbc4d401e1a65dfaf18c290","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore two medial straight lines D, E, commensurable in square only, and containing a medial rectangle, have been found such that the square on the greater is greater than the square on the less by the square on a straight line commensurable with the greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,发现有2,中项无理线段,D,E,平方可公度而长度不可公度,中项无理线段,矩形,正方形,数量大于正方形,数量小于正方形,数量大于正方形,数量大的直线可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0b18c7a9ec1025ac7a2703c5e359a37238e63e6f800d97a0aa03384bf6a83aa6","citations":["euclid-10-30"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly again it can be proved that the square on D is greater than the square on E by the square on a straight line incommensurable with D, when the square on A is greater than the square on C by the square on a straight line incommensurable with A. [[X. 30](/principles/euclid-10-30)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,D线上的正方形比E线上的正方形比不可公度上不可公度上正方形比D线上不可公度,A线上的正方形比C线上正方形比不可公度上A线上正方形比号线上正方形比号线上不可公度比A线上号线上正方形比正方形比正方形比正方形比号线上不可公度比A线上正方形比正方形比不可公度比。 [[X. 30](/principles/euclid-10-30)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1a1184b08b40be72b56a576cf04bb1076c3ea1207edf9608a068f1999ed54e8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. Let ABC be a right-angled triangle having the angle A right, and let the perpendicular AD be drawn; I say that the rectangle CB, BD is equal to the square on BA, the rectangle BC, CD equal to the square on CA, the rectangle BD, DC equal to the square on AD, and, further, the rectangle BC, AD equal to the rectangle BA, AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"引理. 让ABC成为直角三角形,拥有直角 A, 并且让其穿孔AD;我说,矩形 CB, BD等于BA的正方形, 矩形, CD等于CA的正方形, 矩形, BD等于AD, AD, DC等于正方形, BC, AD等于矩形, BA, AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"157b6114ef301b18b70cca29519a3421899f94ad2a7258aa9eff37a49c8505f6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And first that the rectangle CB, BD is equal to the square on BA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,矩形 CB,BD等于BA的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"754d820f1b86e6941424a6255a71ee2d8047db0b103f3403aabcea31fcbfb351","citations":["euclid-6-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since in a right-angled triangle AD has been drawn from the right angle perpendicular to the base, therefore the triangles ABD, ADC are similar both to the whole ABC and to one another. [[VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,在直角三角形 AD中,从直角直角到底边,因此三角形ABD,ADC与整个ABC和彼此相似。 [[VI. 8](/principles/euclid-6-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cafb201ef0d6f24982cf5d0b3af23d493fc7ae388f8a96b04c85af075f868341","citations":["euclid-6-4","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since the triangle ABC is similar to the triangle ABD, therefore, as CB is to BA, so is BA to BD; [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] therefore the rectangle CB, BD is equal to the square on AB. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于三角形ABC与三角形ABD相似,因此,CB对BA的比等于BA对BD的比;因此,矩形对CB、BD等于AB对正方形的比；CB 与 BA 之比等于 BA 与 BD 之比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35f28596c14d82dd729b03ea5e8a936711ff13dc17d863da8315b9b88af51fb2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the rectangle BC, CD is also equal to the square on AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样原因,矩形 BC,CD也等于AC的正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1e5ade2e8b6ff2c6ba4be97fd985442e1db35d229363c6e0b787bb4a5b1b391","citations":["euclid-6-8","euclid-6-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, if in a right-angled triangle a perpendicular be drawn from the right angle to the base, the perpendicular so drawn is a mean proportional between the segments of the base, [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)] therefore, as BD is to DA, so is AD to DC; therefore the rectangle BD, DC is equal to the square on AD. [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于如果在直角三角形中,直径从直角到底边,直径在底边各段之间为比例中项,BD到DA的比例等于AD到DC;因此,矩形 BD等于AD和正方形；BD 与 DA 之比等于 AD 与 DC 之比。 [[VI. 8, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-8)] [[VI. 17](/principles/euclid-6-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0af9f20705c9a3f6999963ad74fc4f1d7e7ee12299a5c2444a053b1a1697ee53","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the rectangle BC, AD is also equal to the rectangle BA, AC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,矩形 BC,AD 也等于矩形 BA,AC。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c5d1ef8918655a8d9185f7f713958ad8747a89803b9f6e8db229eae7291372b6","citations":["euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as we said, ABC is similar to ABD, therefore, as BC is to CA, so is BA to AD. [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,正如我们所说,ABC与ABD类似,因此,BC与CA的比等于BA与AD的比；BC 与 CA 之比等于 BA 与 AD 之比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":21,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e24d63397bcec6437eaed5ace1b09f7f16554298a863986f5d64e5f1ba2712dd","citations":["euclid-6-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the rectangle BC, AD is equal to the rectangle BA, AC. [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)] Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,矩形 BC,AD等于矩形 BA,AC。证毕。 [[VI. 16](/principles/euclid-6-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-32.source","contentId":"euclid-10-32","revisionId":"euclid-10-32@raw-9a495b6a9e7609a6","order":22,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9ed887674207a69828707bdd1410287a19c61d87dc2dfd8b81c2e21c390836c2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-32:euclid-10-29:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-32.construction.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-29","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32/","sourceLabel":"X. 29"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-32:euclid-10-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-32.proof.1","euclid-10-32.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.32/","sourceLabel":"X. 21"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-10-32:euclid-10-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-32","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-32.proof.4"],"tar